<title>PHILIPPINES: Late buying buoys Manila shares at close.</title>
<headline>Late buying buoys Manila shares at close.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------- Jan 8 ----------------------------</p>
<p>		   * Petron, PNB lead gainers</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Philippine shares eked out a modest gain on Wednesday, lifted by late-session buying on selected blue-chips, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors are getting into the groove of things after a long holiday,&quot; Allan Araullo, vice president of Regina Capital Development Corp, said.</p>
<p>The main index ended 11.52 points, or 0.36 percent, higher at 3,206.99, after drifting sideways throughout most of the session.</p>
